        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical lattice clocks have transformed time and frequency metrology and now enable sensitive tests and measurements far beyond clockkeeping.",
        "attribution": "Katori and Ye are the clear central figures in conceiving, realizing, and advancing the optical-lattice-clock platform.",
