        "nobel_worthiness": "Squeezed light made a quantum limit into a practical route to improved interferometric measurement, notably in gravitational-wave astronomy.",
        "attribution": "Caves supplied the central quantum-measurement insight, while Mavalvala and Schnabel represent decisive experimental development and deployment.",
        "maturity": "The technique is repeatedly demonstrated in demanding observatories and is now a dependable precision-measurement tool.",
